(nonrational-cusp configurations of total degree15 at61. The main proof) Tj T*
(work/degree15/PROOF.txt explains these certificates and their coverage.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(In particular, the present argument only has to exclude red\(D\)=P15.) Tj T*
(The degree15 condition is exact: a point over a degree15 field has degree) Tj T*
(1,3,5, or15, and the first three degrees cannot support61-torsion by the) Tj T*
(known rational, cubic and quintic classifications.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Write delta_a for the geometric diamond \(E,P\) -> \(E,aP\), and put) Tj T*
( Delta=\(Z/61Z\)^*/{+1,-1},) Tj T*
( H5=<delta_3>=<delta_2^6>, H15=<delta_4>,) Tj T*
( Y=X/H5, Z=X/H15, C=X_0\(61\).) Tj T*
