(Thus Z/<s>=C. All curves, maps and diamond actions are defined over Q.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(2. EXACT JACOBIAN AND REDUCTION CERTIFICATES) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(The following properties are verified by the supplied calculations:) Tj T*
( \(i\)  \(delta_3-1\)J_X\(Q\) is finite;) Tj T*
( \(ii\) \(s-1\)J_Z\(Q\) is finite;) Tj T*
( \(iii\) J_X\(Q\)[2]=0;) Tj T*
( \(iv\) delta_2 and delta_3 fix P15 as a closed divisor.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(For \(i\) and \(ii\), finite_diamonds.m works in the sign+ cuspidal modular) Tj T*
(symbol spaces of dimensions126 and8. In projected period coordinates,) Tj T*
(the Hecke action is the transpose of DualHeckeOperator. The script) Tj T*
(checks compatibility with the ambient Hecke action through the exact) Tj T*
(projection matrix; it does not identify matrices in different bases.) Tj T*
(It recovers D2=\(T2^2-T4\)/2 and uses the projected winding vector e.) Tj T*
(The rows e*T2^k, 0<=k<g, span spaces of dimensions123 and7. The images) Tj T*
(of D2^6-1 and D2-1, respectively of dimensions100 and4, lie in these) Tj T*
(winding spaces. This is checked by rational matrix ranks. The winding) Tj T*
(rank-zero theorem therefore gives \(i\) and \(ii\). Inverting the diamond) Tj T*
(convention changes neither the relevant kernels nor their images.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(For \(iii\), two61_data.m contains integral matrices on the actual) Tj T*
(sign0 Betti homology lattice of JOne\(61\), of rank252. For q=3,5,7,) Tj T*
(the matrices A_q=T_q-1-q*<q> annihilate rational2-torsion, by good) Tj T*
