(Each Magma command should be logged to its corresponding .log file.) Tj T*
(The reduction script uses the installed mdmagma library at the absolute) Tj T*
(AttachSpec path in that script. The Sage checker also reads the prior) Tj T*
(actual-Jacobian export two61_data.m. To regenerate that export, run:) Tj T*
